# Copy to .env.production (or .env) to change these for another deployment.

# The public address of the deployed site, without a trailing slash. It makes the sharing
# tags in index.html absolute (og:image, twitter:image, og:url, the canonical link), which
# link previews on social sites require. The default is https://astrodemo.multifaceted.info
# (set in vite.config.ts); leave the value empty for root-relative paths.
# VITE_SITE_URL=https://example.com

# The place-search and time-zone service, if not the default.
# VITE_GEOTZ_BASE=https://geotz.multifaceted.info
